MCP request -> response or notification acknowledgement
    Validate transport method, origin, protocol version and bounded JSON envelope.
    Initialize the tools capability, answer pings, list schemas or invoke a tool.
    Validate required and allowed arguments before execution.
    Evaluate through the persistent strict workspace; call objects through NATS.
    List objects, inspect runtime state or return coordinator metrics.
    Return execution failures as error tool results and protocol failures as RPC errors.
    Reject invalid request identifiers, malformed initialization and invalid Value kinds.
    Describe argument fields and read-only tool annotations in discovery.

official SDK interoperability client
    Connect, negotiate protocol, discover tools and test persistent object operations.
    Verify live inspection, root path, metrics and nested error handling.
    Clear the test variable and disconnect; fail the process when a check fails.

Tool arguments
    Source text, object identifier, method selector and ordinary Value arguments.
Tool result
    Text entries and an execution-error flag.
